    </DemoExample>

    <DemoExample Title="Color" RazorCode="@example13RazorCode" Id="example13">
        <div>
            <b>Color</b> paints the animated part of the shimmer - the wave band, or the block the pulse and the fade play on - in any of the general
            colors of bit BlazorUI, over the resting <BitLink Href="#example12">Background</BitLink> of the placeholder.
        </div>
        <br /><br />
        <div>Primary</div>
